Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-Itsuka crossed the finish line\Nbefore you pushed...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirits. Special designation disaster\Nbeings that exist in a critical space.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach 1: Annihilate them by military force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach 2: Date them and\Nmake them fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:11.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Twelve:\N'Make Shido Itsuka Swoon'"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My body's... burning....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency analysis shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The path between all you and Shin\Nhas drastically narrowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...which is hindering\Ncirculation of Spirit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Basically, all that Spirit power is\Ncausing Shido's body to overheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Since it has nowhere to go,\Nit's giving Shido incredible powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but it's possible he'll go on a rampage\Nwith all eight of our Spirit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That would be terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can we do to save Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The answer is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiss him. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:03:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of you kissing Shin will open the path\Nfor Spirit power to flow again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your time limit is 12 tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-By 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...we have to kiss Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kissing Shido to save him\Nis like the icing on the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bad news, Commander!\NShido escaped from the infirmary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido Itsuka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A woman...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a woman... Gotta make her fall for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my duty after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've missed you so much, Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think Shido did this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonder. Such Spirit power...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luckily, we know where he is by the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll head straight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can you be doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're inside my Territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so hostile, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want us to understand one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This joke of yours isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not joking though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget Ratatoskr and DEM.\NWe can still love one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen, it's you that I--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't cause me too much trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My cute Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How humiliating! You'll pay\Nfor this, Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, my body's light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel great! Everyone's power\Nis surging inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:04:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sky is blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my heart is clear and bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tohka! Kotori! Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you all come to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, Shido. We've come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? You all want to kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! With an especially passionate smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, I'll kinda regret losing this power...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, there's a condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listening. Let's hear it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made all of you fall for me\Nin order to seal your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, you have to make me fall for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But to be honest, I already\Nlike all of you guys as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So to say "Make me fall for you"\Nis a bit off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Use whatever method you want.\NMake my heart skip a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough that I can't wait to kiss you. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make his heart skip a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough that he'll want to kiss us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So be it. Ratatoskr will go\Nall-out to make you fall for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me know once you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's get started... and begin our date!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our time limit is 12 o'clock.\NWe have until then to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the place? Let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look lovely, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You went out and picked swimsuits\Njust for me? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Caution. What are you falling for him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido's supposed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ratatoskr presents...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one and only heart-throbbing\NFall in Love Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fall in Love Dome?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Allow me to explain the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Spirits will take turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...trying to make Shido's heart\Nskip a beat in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be closely monitoring Shido's\Nexcitement level here in the control room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And once it exceeds a certain level...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...you'll hear a fanfare like this\Nwhich signals a triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kissing Shido will come after\Neveryone completes their turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The time limit is 12 o'clock tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do I make myself clear, everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get one thing straight, Kannazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the time to screw\Naround with our choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your unworthy dog, Kyouhei Kannazuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,will surmount Shido whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That wording sorta puts me off...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we're using a beach, why isn't it\Nnudist like I originally suggested?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nudist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If our goal is to excite Shido,\Nit's more effective to catch him off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If everyone here was naked, we'd already\Nbe hearing the fanfare by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That might be true, but there's\Ncertain things we can and can't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I get what you're saying, Origami,\Nbut that may have the opposite effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His shock might exceed the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Then I'll strip bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the way to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the way, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The vice commander and Origami\Nsure make a good combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like they're always\Non the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Must be all those hobbies they share.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then! Let's get this\Nconquest of Shido underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we have any volunteers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A true warrior is first to the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we get this ball rolling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pride. Leave this to Kaguya and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! The Yamai Sisters are first up to bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the Hurricane Children for you!\NRushing forth like the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two girls at once, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be gentle with me please. Kaguya... Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare yourself, Shido.\NWe'll make you fall for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For sure. KO in one round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:43.77,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"1: Surround Shido on both sides\Nand touch him with a squeeze attack.\N2: Sneak a vanilla-flavored kiss using an ice cream cone. 3: Ride Shido together like he's a human banana boat."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.52,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"1: Surround Shido on both sides\Nand touch him with a squeeze attack.\N2: Sneak a vanilla-flavored kiss using an ice cream cone. 3: Ride Shido together like he's a human banana boat."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.02,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"3: Ride Shido together like\Nhe's a human banana boat."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your choices, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, one or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aww! But what about choice three?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Strap a rope around his neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:10:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hear that, you two?! Go with three\Nand ride Shido like a human--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:00.08,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Ratatoskr presents"\N"Fall in Love"\N"Dome event"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.45,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Sorry\NPlease wait"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, what are you doing, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A coup d'état? Revolution?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The commander gave orders to tie you up\Nif you started screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, what a commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, tie me up tighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!\NThe left side is way too slack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--What's that idiot doing?\N--Hold on! You're doing it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I guess that means it's number two\Nand the squeeze attack then.\N--Hold on! You're doing it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I guess that means it's number two\Nand the squeeze attack then.\N--Ah, I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's that, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't our charms make your heart flutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. It's no use\Ntrying to lie to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There... There!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey now, I like it, but you girls should\Nhold off on this stuff till you're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shock. Shido's not fazed in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But thank you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're both trying so hard for me.\NI appreciate the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blush. I feel cheated for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, cheer up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He may look composed, but Shin's\Nexcitement level is climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try out two this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You went to get ice cream but\Nonly for yourselves? I'm sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heh, a hasty conclusion, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bestow. One of these is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One will be plenty for Kaguya and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweetness...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't hold back...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to disturb you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...weren't you supposed to do that\Nwith Shin and not with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Neglect. Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coldness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurray! Today's very first fanfare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yamai Sisters! You made him fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness. You got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Next up is Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You volunteered all on\Nyour own? Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah right. The rest of us drew straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This condition of yours is absurd...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The others might be able to manage,\Nbut to make you fall for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're plenty cute, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't do it! Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's do some multiplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, but Natsumi doesn't even own the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can play by herself then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You knew I didn't own the game\Nfrom the very start, you big jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I've got him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, it's too dangerous\Nto be using Spirit power right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Revert back at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine. I'm using a real swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll fall for me quick anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, Shido. Sorry to keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, your body is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Shido, I know you're\Ninterested in a big girl's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another success!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi's baggy swimsuit for the win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino, your suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no worries. Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino scores a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey now, this is a whole\Ndifferent mood than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Having just the beach is boring, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But from here on out,\Nit's adult time. Elegant time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say boys grow up quickly, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But a lady can change\Nin the moment you look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understand, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my commander! Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, I want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...sing a song just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But I haven't even sung yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Next up is you, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No liquor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem. It's alcohol-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's alcohol-free all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is it that you're so handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka? Wait... You're the Origami from then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it really make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever I think about you,\Nit makes me all fuzzy inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my heart gets all tight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka, I love... I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you so much, I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami success!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's seven of us clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just Tohka now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's just, when I heard\NOrigami say she loved Shido,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I felt my chest squeezing tight right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saving Shido should be my priority, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I can't stop thinking about this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These silly thoughts get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not some silly thought at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's the most important\Nfeeling you'll need to save Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To save Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on. We're counting on you, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird... Wasn't that\Ndrink earlier alcohol-free?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka? That's impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I figured you'd be getting hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought all the tasty foods\Nwith me! Shall we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah. Thank...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Shido!\N--What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Shido!\N--Not good. It happened sooner than we thought
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You okay, Shido? Get a hold--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Get away... from me... Tohka!\N--You okay, Shido? Get a hold--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Flashing... Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's abnormal Spirit waves\Npouring out of Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His Spirit powers are off the charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of his emotion readings\Nare unreadable! He's on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spatial quake alarm, full danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, we'll have an even worse\Ndisaster than the one 30 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, what are you doing?!\NWe have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency. It's a race against time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:18:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right... I'll deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In case this ever happened,\Nand to eliminate Shido when it did
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,is why Ratatoskr made Dainsleif.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, big brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me for having no way out but this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You must never use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll all find a way somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami is right. You're not alone, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's Origami and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya, Yuzuru, Yoshino,\NMiku, and Natsumi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we put our powers together,\NI know we can save Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka... Origami... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't slow Shido down\Nsomehow, we'll never catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can be so whimsical sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened? This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We won't have long to make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Relax. It's long enough for the speedy Yamai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Raphael, El Re'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Response. Raphael, El Nahash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, we'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grateful. Just like you saved us back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll save you soon, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aww, you didn't even make it a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's an indirect kiss with Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:19:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Kotori!\N--Big brother, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Your final opponent is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're outta time! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her power's gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Tohka!\N--Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't... interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I have to do this on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you always been fighting\Nthis pain and fear this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you stop moving forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How were you able to keep reaching out\Nin order to save all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This must be the feeling\Nthat everyone calls love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's different than\Nmy love for the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a love just for Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:21:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tohka. Sure you don't want me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.53,0:23:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the only one who didn't\Nget you to fall for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All done, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your heart skip a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it totally did.
